Reorganization. -The
Cabinet Oversight Committee
on Internal
(COC-IS), is hereby reorganized
composed of the following:
President of the Republic of the Philippines as Chairperson:
of the Core Staff:
Executive Secretary;
Secretary of National Defense;
Secretary of the Interior and Local Government;
Secretary of Foreign Affairs;
Presidential Chief of Staff;
National Security Adviser;
Presidential Adviser on the Peace Process;
viii. Presidential Adviser for Special Concerns;
Presidential Adviser on Military Affairs;
Presidential Adviser on Police Affairs;
Presidential Consultant on Counter-Intelligence;

xii. Presidential
Assistant on Mindanao and other Regional
Presidential Assistants as needed;
Other Members of the Executive Committee; and
Leaders of Congress.
The Presidential
Adviser on Strategic Concerns shall assist the
President in overseeing the Core Staff.
